{"audio": "voiceover.wav", "duration": 49.52, "segments": [{"start": 0.09, "end": 4.45, "text": "90% of students get EBITDA wrong in interviews. Let's fix that in under a minute.", "words": [{"w": "90%", "s": 0.09, "e": 0.31}, {"w": "of", "s": 0.31, "e": 0.48}, {"w": "students", "s": 0.48, "e": 0.95}, {"w": "get", "s": 0.95, "e": 1.17}, {"w": "EBITDA", "s": 1.17, "e": 1.54}, {"w": "wrong", "s": 1.54, "e": 1.86}, {"w": "in", "s": 1.86, "e": 2.03}, {"w": "interviews.", "s": 2.03, "e": 2.65}, {"w": "Let's", "s": 2.65, "e": 2.96}, {"w": "fix", "s": 2.96, "e": 3.18}, {"w": "that", "s": 3.18, "e": 3.44}, {"w": "in", "s": 3.44, "e": 3.61}, {"w": "under", "s": 3.61, "e": 3.92}, {"w": "a", "s": 3.92, "e": 4.04}, {"w": "minute.", "s": 4.04, "e": 4.45}]}, {"start": 4.82, "end": 9.51, "text": "EBITDA stands for earnings before interest, taxes, depreciation, and amortisation.", "words": [{"w": "EBITDA", "s": 4.82, "e": 5.16}, {"w": "stands", "s": 5.16, "e": 5.49}, {"w": "for", "s": 5.49, "e": 5.7}, {"w": "earnings", "s": 5.7, "e": 6.12}, {"w": "before", "s": 6.12, "e": 6.45}, {"w": "interest,", "s": 6.45, "e": 6.92}, {"w": "taxes,", "s": 6.92, "e": 7.73}, {"w": "depreciation,", "s": 7.73, "e": 8.5}, {"w": "and", "s": 8.5, "e": 8.74}, {"w": "amortisation.", "s": 8.74, "e": 9.51}]}, {"start": 9.94, "end": 17.47, "text": "In simple words, it is the profit a business makes from its core operations before financing decisions, tax, and non-cash charges.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 9.94, "e": 10.12}, {"w": "simple", "s": 10.12, "e": 10.51}, {"w": "words,", "s": 10.51, "e": 10.89}, {"w": "it", "s": 10.89, "e": 11.08}, {"w": "is", "s": 11.08, "e": 11.27}, {"w": "the", "s": 11.27, "e": 11.52}, {"w": "profit", "s": 11.52, "e": 11.92}, {"w": "a", "s": 11.92, "e": 12.06}, {"w": "business", "s": 12.06, "e": 12.57}, {"w": "makes", "s": 12.57, "e": 12.93}, {"w": "from", "s": 12.93, "e": 13.23}, {"w": "its", "s": 13.23, "e": 13.47}, {"w": "core", "s": 13.47, "e": 13.77}, {"w": "operations", "s"